"&DOCUMENTS, &DOWNLOAD, &MUSIC, &PICTURES, &PUBLIC_SHARE, &TEMPLATES, "
"&VIDEOS. See /etc/xdg/user-dirs.defaults and $HOME/.config/user-dirs.default"
